# Scan diagnostics: the tooling (the two scripts and the README) is versioned,
# because the app's README explains how to reproduce a diagnosis with it. What
# it *generates* is not: reports embed renders and are tens to hundreds of KB.
/diagnostics/*.html
/diagnostics/*.png
/diagnostics/*.json
/diagnostics/__pycache__/
__pycache__/
